.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

.secrets/
.world/

# afk run artifacts the driver writes into this repo on every `--cycle` (keep .afk/config.toml,
# ignore the noise). Tracking any of them wedges the nightly: the run writes, nothing commits,
# and the next preflight aborts on a dirty tree. docs/dev-cycle/ already has its own `*`.
.afk/transcripts/
.afk/worktrees/
.afk/mailbox/
# Shadow-parity ledgers (afk#1149/#1155): per-node legacy-vs-new decision records that
# accumulate toward a LOCAL agreement bar. Machine-local by construction — never shared.
.afk/parity/
